    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist it Now!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1754418087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1754418087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/14a5f70cf8ac6a4ddf472e80ec3ec745.poster.avif?t=1754418087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/14a5f70cf8ac6a4ddf472e80ec3ec745.webm?t=1754418087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/14a5f70cf8ac6a4ddf472e80ec3ec745.mp4?t=1754418087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/2c9f35f8509bf50bc74800c07284577c.avif?t=1754418087\" /></div><br><br>I Was Lost is an upcoming game that combines 2D mazes, sliding puzzles, and narrative to create a unique experience. In it, each level is made from a poem's verse unraveling as you progress through the game. \u200bControl not only your position on the board but also move walls to create new paths and escape from seemingly impossible situations.     <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/eb9e68e721abe01e6727b5631c8f9e16.avif?t=1754418087\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/933174438031fc8b85ef252c533f08aa.avif?t=1754418087\" /></div><br><br>The experience was designed thinking on accessibility and includes:<br>Change board letters to numbers if you don't understand the language<br>Speed regulation to avoid abrupt movements or to speedrun<br>Color palettes accessible for different types of daltonism<br>One-hand control scheme and key-binding<br>Available in English and Portuguese<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/729fc77e450935bbe88966c7327a52a7.avif?t=1754418087\" /></div><br><br>With the level editor, you have the opportunity of telling your own stories and share them on our Discord Community with players all around the world!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/14a5f70cf8ac6a4ddf472e80ec3ec745.poster.avif?t=1754418087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/14a5f70cf8ac6a4ddf472e80ec3ec745.webm?t=1754418087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/14a5f70cf8ac6a4ddf472e80ec3ec745.mp4?t=1754418087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/2c9f35f8509bf50bc74800c07284577c.avif?t=1754418087\" /></div><br><br>I Was Lost is an upcoming game that combines 2D mazes, sliding puzzles, and narrative to create a unique experience. In it, each level is made from a poem's verse unraveling as you progress through the game. \u200bControl not only your position on the board but also move walls to create new paths and escape from seemingly impossible situations.     <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/eb9e68e721abe01e6727b5631c8f9e16.avif?t=1754418087\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/933174438031fc8b85ef252c533f08aa.avif?t=1754418087\" /></div><br><br>The experience was designed thinking on accessibility and includes:<br>Change board letters to numbers if you don't understand the language<br>Speed regulation to avoid abrupt movements or to speedrun<br>Color palettes accessible for different types of daltonism<br>One-hand control scheme and key-binding<br>Available in English and Portuguese<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935420/extras/729fc77e450935bbe88966c7327a52a7.avif?t=1754418087\" /></div><br><br>With the level editor, you have the opportunity of telling your own stories and share them on our Discord Community with players all around the world!",
    "short_description": "Move walls, avoid danger in a labyrinthic poem, and create your own stories in this unique puzzle experience where each level is a poem's verse unraveling as you progress. Control not only your position but also move walls to create new paths and escape from seemingly impossible situations.",
